0     # Rust, before the fix
[0m[0m[0m
[0m[0m
Fixed by calling [38;5;10msignal(SIGPIPE, SIG_DFL)[0m as the first statement of [38;5;10mmain[0m in [38;5;10mtranslation/src/main.rs[0m. Note this class of defect is invisible to a test that compares [38;5;10mExitStatus::code()[0m — a signalled process reports [38;5;10mNone[0m on both sides — so [38;5;10massert_same[0m compares the whole [38;5;10mExitStatus[0m.[0m[0m
[0m[0m
